d":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yIBXx","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-19T15:10:04Z","updated_at":"2025-06-19T15:10:04Z","body":"On 4.4.1 (49a5bc7), the killed subtween still runs:\n```gdscript\ntw = create_tween()\ntw.tween_property(icon, \"position:x\", 500, 1.0)\n\nvar subtween = create_tween()\nsubtween.tween_property(icon, \"rotation_degrees\", 90, 1.0)\nsubtween.kill()\n\ntw.tween_subtween(subtween)\ntw.tween_property(icon, \"position:y\", 200, 1.0)\n```\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4fec919e-5ea6-4ff5-a092-d88a4cc4150c\n\nAn explicitly killed tween being run seems wrong, so I'm not sure I would consider it a \"regression\" per se.\n\nCommit ccc134f has the same behavior (i.e., the killed subtween runs), but at commit 0c7b4fd the error appears.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2988447217/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2988465320","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107688#issuecomment-2988465320","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107688","id":2988465320,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yIFyo","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-19T15:17:26Z","updated_at":"2025-06-19T15:17:26Z","body":"Then the underlying bug is probably older and https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103198 just exposed it\n\nCC @SaracenOne ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2988465320/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2988490002","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107688#issuecomment-2988490002","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107688","id":2988490002,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yIL0S","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-19T15:26:54Z","updated_at":"2025-06-19T21:49:06Z","body":"My interpretation was that the underlying bug was with my original code for `tween_subtween`, which would call `play()` on its child tween without regard to if it was still valid or not:\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/5abed52fd9d99c4aab7d8c62d505f9ad618e4533/scene/animation/tween.cpp#L868-L874\n\nThe `Tween::play()` method itself raises an error if the tween in question isn't valid:\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/5abed52fd9d99c4aab7d8c62d505f9ad618e4533/scene/animation/tween.cpp#L193-L197\n\nIn my mind, #103198 makes good sense - once a tween is killed, it shouldn't be considered valid or be allowed to play anymore, despite what `SubtweenTweener` was trying to do.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2988490002/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]